	"Fans love it. They won't (-10).": "A los fans les encanta. A él, no (-10).",
	"Fans love it. They won't (-8).": "A los fans les encanta. A él, no (-8).",
	"Like their posts, reply kindly, team up: that makes friends. Fights and trash talk make rivals.": "Dale me gusta, responde con amabilidad, haz equipo: así se hacen amigos. Peleas y provocaciones hacen rivales.",
	"No love lost between you.": "No os tenéis ningún cariño.",
	"Nobody wants to take on the two of you tonight.": "Nadie quiere enfrentarse a vosotros dos esta noche.",
	"Reposted.": "Compartido.",
	"Safe. Both of them warm up to you (+3).": "Seguro. Los dos te cogen cariño (+3).",
	"Safe. Sponsors like it. They warm up to you (+4).": "Seguro. A los patrocinadores les gusta. Te coge cariño (+4).",
	"Strangers %s": "Desconocidos %s",
	"TAG TEAM PICKUP": "PELEA POR PAREJAS",
	"Team up": "Hacer equipo",
	"The winner loves it (+6).": "Al ganador le encanta (+6).",
	"They like you. Likes, replies and a tag team or two make friends.": "Le caes bien. Me gusta, respuestas y alguna pelea por parejas hacen amigos.",
	"They warm up to you (+5).": "Te coge cariño (+5).",
	"They won't fight beside you.": "No quiere pelear a tu lado.",
	"Two on two. Both robots share one heavyweight's power, with less health and punch. Fight side by side and you make a friend.": "Dos contra dos. Los dos robots comparten la energía de un peso pesado, con menos vida y pegada. Pelea codo con codo y ganas un amigo.",
	"YOUR PARTNER": "TU COMPAÑERO",
	"Your best friend in Port Ferrum.": "Tu mejor amigo en Port Ferrum.",
	"Your nemesis. Only beating them settles it.": "Tu némesis. Solo ganarle lo zanja.",
